[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0558","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1352","title":"GNU elfutils eu-readelf libdw_alloc.c __libdw_thread_tail 内存破坏漏洞","description":"tags as specified.<value>GNU elfutils 0.192 的 eu-readelf 组件存在内存破坏漏洞，位于 libdw_alloc.c 中的 __libdw_thread_tail 函数在处理参数 w 时存在内存管理错误，可导致堆缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响使用 elfutils 0.192 版本处理 ELF 二进制文件及 DWARF 调试信息的各类 Linux 发行版和应用程序。攻击者可通过网络向目标发送特制 ELF 文件，诱导用户使用 eu-readelf 工具打开恶意文件，从而操纵参数 w 触发内存损坏，进而可能导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。由于攻击复杂度较高且需满足特定交互条件，利用难度较大，但漏洞利用细节已公开披露。GNU 官方已通过提交 2636426a091bd6c6f7f02e49ab20d4cdc6bfc753 修复了该问题，建议受影响用户尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1352"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-16T15:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GNU elfutils 至包含修复补丁 2636426a091bd6c6f7f02e49ab20d4cdc6bfc753 的版本（≥0.192 修复版）。各发行版用户请通过包管理器更新：SUSE 用户应用 SUSE-SU-2025:4092-1 补丁包；Ubuntu 用户应用 UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1352 更新；Siemens RUGGEDCOM RST2428P 用户升级至 V4.0 以上版本（参考 https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-253495.html）。如暂无法升级，可临时限制非受信 ELF 文件的 eu-readelf 处理操作，避免处理来源不明的二进制文件。也可从 https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15923 下载官方补丁手动编译修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15923","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32650","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32650#c2","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295960","https://vuldb.com/?id.295960","https://vuldb.com/?submit.495965","https://www.gnu.org/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-253495.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-1352.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/2911be3264007af9623a080cb675cf4852c504f7/2025/CVE-2025-1352.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1352.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1352.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13523.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1352.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1352.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1352.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1352.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/6b93a174634cc0755a555ba6e9fd5dd4026076e8/SPECS/elfutils/CVE-2025-1352.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0420","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0420.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0998","title":"Chromium V8 越界内存访问漏洞","description":"Chromium V8 引擎存在越界内存访问漏洞，攻击者可利用特制的 JavaScript 代码触发 V8 引擎中的越界读写操作，导致信息泄露或程序崩溃。该漏洞影响基于 Chromium 的浏览器（包括 Google Chrome 及 Microsoft Edge 等），Microsoft Edge 已在 133.0.3065.69 版本中修复。NVD 标记该漏洞为不可利用，但实际攻击面取决于 V8 引擎的具体上下文。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0998"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-15T02:15:09Z","updated":"2025-04-04T16:15:18Z","remediation":"更新 Microsoft Edge 至 133.0.3065.69 或更高版本，更新 Google Chrome 至修复此 CVE 的对应版本。对于 Debian 12 系统，应用安全公告 DSA-5866 中的更新。如无法立即更新，可限制对不可信网页的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-0998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0998.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43