iases":["CVE-2025-0996"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-15T02:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome for Android 升级至 133.0.6943.98 或更高版本，可通过 Google Play Store 检查并安装更新。使用 Microsoft Edge (Chromium 内核) 的用户需升级至 133.0.3065.69 或更高版本。Debian 用户应执行 `apt update && apt upgrade` 安装 DSA-5866-1 安全更新。临时缓解措施：避免在 Android 设备上点击可疑链接或访问不可信网页。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/02/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_12.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/391788835","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-0996.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0996.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0996.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0996","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/349ffef3a9c323970e6fc080678b2732beb17d26/testing/qt5-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-0996.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-wrgh-9j55-488p/GHSA-wrgh-9j55-488p.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-0996","https://github.com/openSUSE/news-o-o/blob/f00a24fa16e9d957a04b4b8d47c2090853697549/_posts/2025/2025-09-30-tw-monthly-update-sept.md","https://github.com/wagov/wasocshared/blob/600d13e462af32d74b0d6b4ba5f50091455779d1/docs/advisories/20250213002-Google-Chrome-Multiple-Vulnerability-Updates.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0417","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0417.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0995","title":"Google Chrome V8 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发已释放内存的访问，导致堆破坏，进而实现远程代码执行或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 133.0.6943.98 之前版本及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 133.0.3065.69 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级浏览器至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0995"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-15T02:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:29Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 133.0.6943.98 及以上版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户应升级至 133.0.3065.69 及以上版本。Debian 12 用户请执行 `apt update && apt upgrade chromium` 应用 DSA-5866 安全更新。无法立即升级时，可配置浏览器禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施（V8 引擎通过 JS 触发）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/02/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_12.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/391907159","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-0995.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0995.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0995.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0995","https://github.com/0ca/BoxPwnr-Traces/blob/37d5f44cdbc275e629f96a02ff6fda8e17ff9425/exploitbench/v8-cve-2025-0995/traces/20260618_173324/notes.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-0995.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-377p-4737-hx6m/GHSA-377p-4737-hx6m.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-0995","https://github.com/exploitbench/exploitbench/blob/9d0173bcf8835b74a45f60450ae7f184e29e7607/benchmarks/bench-v8/dataset-bootstrap.py","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0995.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0417.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0862","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0862.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21401","title":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）存在安全功能绕过漏洞，源于对 URL 重定向的验证不严（CWE-601）。本地攻击者可通过诱使用户点击特制链接，绕过 Edge 的安全功能限制，导致低程度的机密性、完整性和可用性受损。该漏洞影响 133.0.3065.69 之前版本的 Microsoft Edge，攻击复杂度较高且需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21401"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-15T00:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge 升级至 133.0.3065.69 或更高版本，可通过浏览器内置更新（设置→关于 Microsoft Edge→检查更新）或从官网 https://www.microsoft.com/edge 下载安装。该漏洞为安全功能绕过，攻击者需本地交互触发，无法立即升级时建议禁用不必要的浏览器扩展并启用 Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21401","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21401.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2025/CVE-2025-21401.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-21401.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21401.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-214xx/CVE-2025-21401.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0862.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0380","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0380.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0426","title":"Kubernetes kubelet 容器检查点请求导致节点拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Kubernetes kubelet 组件的只读 HTTP 端点存在未授权访问漏洞，未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向该端点发送大量容器检查点（checkpoint）请求，导致节点磁盘空间被迅速耗尽，从而引发节点拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有启用 kubelet 只读端口的 Kubernetes 集群，攻击者无需任何权限即可从本地网络触发，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中等。建议升级 Kubernetes 至修复版本或禁用 kubelet 只读端口以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0426"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-13T16:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:27Z","remediation":"立即将 kubelet 升级至 v1.30.10、v1.31.6 或 v1.32.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 kubelet 启动参数中添加 `--read-only-port=0` 禁用只读端口，或通过网络策略限制对 kubelet 10250/10255 端口的未授权访问，并监控节点磁盘使用量以发现异常写操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/130016","https://groups.google.com/g/kubernetes-security-announce/c/KiODfu8i6w8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/13/1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0426.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0426.json","https://github.com/klts-io/website/blob/227a6395ea80131a21b3ad8068f6256e7eb2300f/content/en/docs/kubernetes/patches/cve-2025-0426.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/k8s.io/kubernetes/CVE-2025-0426.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0426","https://github.com/aws/eks-distro/blob/df6eaceef11dd65a4d8f0bcdd40f2de7f5cdac00/docs/contents/releases/1-32/7/CHANGELOG-v1-32-eks-7.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0426.json","https://github.com/stackrox/k8s-cves/blob/7c6e98fff4e5c510beea5eb8764b9cc381660340/cves/CVE-2025-0426.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-0426.md","https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/aws-efs-csi-driver/blob/a4fc67600be60d0f8350dc9459e55ff04e9aa944/CHANGELOG-2.x.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0380.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0440","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1094","title":"PostgreSQL libpq 引用函数 SQL注入漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 的 libpq 库中的转义函数（PQescapeLiteral、PQescapeIdentifier、PQescapeString、PQescapeStringConn）存在引号语法中和不当漏洞（CWE-149）。当应用程序使用这些函数的返回值构造 psql 交互式终端的输入时，数据库输入提供者可利用编码验证失败的文本注入恶意 SQL 语句，导致 SQL 注入攻击。此外，当客户端编码为 BIG5 且服务器编码为 EUC_TW 或 MULE_INTERNAL 时，PostgreSQL 命令行工具也存在类似问题，命令行参数来源可通过编码转换差异绕过引号转义。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但利用复杂度较高（需特定编码环境）。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 17.3、16.7、15.11、14.16、13.19 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高，可导致数据泄露、篡改及未授权访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1094"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-13T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 PostgreSQL 至 17.3、16.7、15.11、14.16 或 13.19 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在应用程序中避免将 PQescapeLiteral() 等函数的结果直接拼接后传入 psql 交互终端，并确保 client_encoding 不使用 BIG5 编码。同时限制数据库连接来源 IP，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2025-1094/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/16/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/20/1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00015.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00024.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250221-0010/","https://github.com/TranDongA3/POC-CVE-2025-1094","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1094.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2025/CVE-2025-1094.json","https://github.com/EnterpriseDB/docs/blob/507b9d6dd498f598e319dd17f5edc6450567cb32/advocacy_docs/security/assessments/cve-2025-1094.mdx","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/50f657ad5d1fd5bd0d62718361ee31e898f44d48/data/2025/CVE-2025-1094-aninfosec_CVE-2025-1094.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/94576818ed78a5f4279cd7c5dd905d16cb5cdd4d/doc/2025-02/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A%E3%80%91PostgreSQL%20SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2025-1094%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-1094.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/b5f1732ac1f4f69dada13f903e365a3a46ee1b07/2025/CVE-2025-1094/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2025-1094-2025-05-31-1205","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fb6b5b3f877cb85d43b44481d8426d9d97694f8/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1094.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/56512a99e34b402634b17f316d7453c65ba4b3f2/2025/CVE-2025-1094.json","https://github.com/soltanali0/CVE-2025-1094-Exploit","https://github.com/ishwardeepp/CVE-2025-1094-PoC-Postgre-SQLi","https://github.com/aninfosec/CVE-2025-1094","https://github.com/Nguyen-Van-Gia-Binh/Fcode-Security-Demo"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0440.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0936","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0936.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21700","title":"Linux 内核网络调度器 Use-After-Free 漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络调度器（net: sched）在处理队列规则（qdisc）替换操作时存在 use-after-free 漏洞。当攻击者使用 tc qdisc replace 命令将子 qdisc 从一个父 qdisc 移动到另一个父 qdisc 时，内核未正确处理引用计数与父子关系，导致同一 qdisc 被两个不同 class 同时引用，且引用计数异常增加。删除相关 class 时会触发对已释放内存的引用，攻击者可利用此漏洞实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，攻击者需要本地低权限访问，通过构造特定的 tc 命令序列即可触发利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21700"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-13T12:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:03Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含补丁 commit 46c59ec33ec9 的稳定版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上。Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 升级到 24.04 的 6.8.0-58.60、22.04 的 5.15.0-138.148 或 20.04 的 5.4.0-214.234 内核包，并重启系统使修改生效。如暂时无法升级内核，可通过取消非必要 tc qdisc replace 操作或限制能执行 tc 命令的本地用户权限作为临时缓解措施，防止本地提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38646749d6e12f9d80a08d21ca39f0beca20230d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/46c59ec33ec98aba20c15117630cae43a01404cc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/73c7e1d6898ccbeee126194dcc05f58b8a795e70","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7e2bd8c13b07e29a247c023c7444df23f9a79fd8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bc50835e83f60f56e9bec2b392fb5544f250fb6f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd796e269123e1994bfc4e99dd76680ba0946a97","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/deda09c0543a66fa51554abc5ffd723d99b191bf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fe18c21d67dc7d1bcce1bba56515b1b0306db19b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21700.md","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/482568ba23f8c3e034242909c8c1db3d79245550/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2025-21700_lts_cos_mitigation/docs/vulnerability.md","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/482568ba23f8c3e034242909c8c1db3d79245550/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2025-21700_lts_cos_mitigation/metadata.json","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/482568ba23f8c3e034242909c8c1db3d79245550/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2025-21700_lts_cos_mitigation/docs/exploit.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21700.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21700.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21700.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/c93d2643e035f504bcc39587d19bad3c64044b2f/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21700.md","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/482568ba23f8c3e034242909c8c1db3d79245550/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2025-38350_cos/docs/exploit.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0936.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0503","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1215","title":"Vim main.c 内存损坏漏洞","description":"Vim 是一款广泛使用的文本编辑器。在 vim 9.1.1096 及之前版本中，src/main.c 文件存在内存损坏漏洞。当用户通过 --log 参数启动 vim 并处理特制文件时，攻击者可利用该漏洞导致程序内存损坏，造成拒绝服务或潜在的内存数据破坏。该漏洞需要本地访问且依赖用户交互（如打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 2.4，危害等级低。升级至 vim 9.1.1097 版本即可修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1215"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T19:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:37Z","remediation":"升级 Vim 至 9.1.1097 或更高版本，该版本已修复 src/main.c 中 --log 参数导致的内存损坏问题。补丁提交为 c5654b84480822817bb7b69ebc97c174c91185e9。如无法立即升级，避免在 Vim 中使用 --log 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vim/vim/commit/c5654b84480822817bb7b69ebc97c174c91185e9","https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/16606","https://github.com/vim/vim/releases/tag/v9.1.1097","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295174","https://vuldb.com/?id.295174","https://vuldb.com/?submit.497546","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250321-0005/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1215-2025-03-21-1705","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-1215","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1215.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1215.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0520","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1244","title":"GNU Emacs 自定义 man URI 方案命令注入漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 文本编辑器中存在命令注入漏洞，源于其对自定义 \"man\" URI 方案处理不当。远程未认证攻击者可通过诱骗用户访问特制网站或包含重定向的 HTTP URL 触发该漏洞，在目标系统上执行任意 shell 命令。该漏洞影响 Emacs 多个版本，攻击无需身份认证但依赖用户交互，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。建议用户升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1244"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T15:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:32Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Emacs 29.4.0 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户请参考 RHSA-2025:1915/RHSA-2025:1917/RHSA-2025:1961 等安全公告安装对应补丁；Debian 用户需更新至 emacs 27.2-4 或更新版本。也可通过禁用 Emacs 中 man:// URI 方案处理或限制不可信来源的文件变量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1915","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1917","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1961","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1962","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1963","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1964","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2022","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2130","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2157","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2195","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2754","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-1244","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345150","https://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/emacs.git/commit/?id=820f0793f0b46448928905552726c1f1b999062f","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/01/2","https://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/bugreport.cgi?bug=66390","https://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/emacs.git/tree/etc/NEWS?h=emacs-30.1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00033.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1244.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1244.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12443.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1244.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1244.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1244.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/bf3e1bab99c0bf9100ac42a0290c766abb391d7c/cmd/osv-processor/transforms.go","https://github.com/emacs-mirror/emacs/blob/9a431e431ad92f94f4290c3f0bf043b0f97a7b56/etc/NEWS.30","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/596 - AppSec Ezine","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1244.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0935","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0935.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21699","title":"Linux 内核 GFS2 文件系统本地权限提升漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Linux内核GFS2文件系统模块存在本地权限提升漏洞。当GFS2_DIF_JDATA标志发生翻转时，系统未能正确截断inode地址空间，导致同一地址空间内混合使用buffer heads与iomap_folio_state结构体，引发内存损坏。该漏洞影响使用GFS2文件系统的Linux内核版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限。成功利用后，攻击者可执行任意代码并完全控制受影响系统，CVSS评分7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21699"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T14:15:33Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:19:28Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至已修复的稳定版本：内核 5.10.234、5.15.178、6.1.128、6.6.75、6.12.12 或 6.13.1 及以上版本均已包含修复补丁（commit e0b2858886ae31d290eb1ffc095f81118bc2f6b3）。Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 升级至对应内核版本：20.04 LTS 升级至 5.4.0-211.231 或 5.15.0-1114.123~20.04.1，22.04 LTS 升级至 5.15.0-135.146，24.04 LTS 升级至 6.8.0-62.65。执行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic 后重启系统使新内核生效。如无法立即升级内核，可临时限制本地用户对 GFS2 文件系统的挂载与操作权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a40a140e11fec699e128170ccaa98b6b82cb503","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4516febe325342555bb09ca5b396fb816d655821","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4dd57d1f0e9844311c635a7fb39abce4f2ac5a61","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e3ded34f3f3c9d7ed2aac7be8cf51153646574a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5bb1fd0855bb0abc7d97e44758d6ffed7882d2d0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7c9d9223802fbed4dee1ae301661bf346964c9d2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c41abc11aa8438c9ed2d973f97e66674c0355df","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21699.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21699.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21699.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21699.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21699.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21699.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21699.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21699.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21699-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21699-2025-11-03-1453"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0935.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0935.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0934","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0934.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21697","title":"Linux kernel drm/v3d 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drm/v3d 显示驱动中存在漏洞，作业执行完成后未将设备中的对应作业指针设置为 NULL。当本地低权限用户卸载该驱动时，内核会误认为相关作业仍处于活动状态并触发告警，可能导致系统不稳定或内存安全问题。该漏洞影响使用 V3D GPU 的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需要具备本地访问权限并拥有低权限账户即可触发，无需用户交互，成功利用可对系统造成拒绝服务或信息泄露风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21697"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T14:15:32Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:19:18Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至已包含修复补丁的稳定版本：5.4.290、5.10.234、5.15.177、6.1.127、6.6.74 或 6.12.11 及更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 应升级至 5.15.0-1077.83 或更高版本，Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 应升级至 5.4.0-1142.153 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/14e0a874488e79086340ba8e2d238cb9596b68a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1bd6303d08c85072ce40ac01a767ab67195105bd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a1c88f7ca5c12dff6fa6787492ac910bb9e4407","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/63195bae1cbf78f1d392b1bc9ae4b03c82d0ebf3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a34050f70e7955a359874dff1a912a748724a140","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b22467b1ae104073dcb11aa78562a331cd7fb0e0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e4b5ccd392b92300a2b341705cc4805681094e49","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21697.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21697.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21697.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21697.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21697.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21697.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21697.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21697-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21697-2025-11-03-1453","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21697.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0934.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0933","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0933.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21696","title":"Linux 内核 mremap 内存管理 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux内核内存管理子系统存在安全漏洞，当使用mremap()系统调用重新映射此前已通过userfaultfd机制注册为写保护的内存区域时，若未开启UFFD_FEATURE_EVENT_REMAP功能，vma虚拟内存区标志与页表项（PTE/PMD）标志之间的清理操作存在不一致，导致uffd-wp写保护标志状态不匹配。此状态差异会在后续调用mprotect(PROT_WRITE)设置页表可写时触发page_table_check_pte_flags()内核警告，造成系统稳定性下降。该漏洞影响使用userfaultfd特性的Linux内核版本，CVSS评分为5.5。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21696"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T14:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:03Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.11 或更高版本（6.12.x 系列），或升级至 6.13 及以上稳定版本。对于 RHEL 9 系统，应更新至 kernel-5.14.0-611.5.1.el9_7 或更高版本；Debian 用户应更新至 6.12.11-1（trixie）或 7.1.3-1（forky）及以上版本。如暂无法升级内核，可临时缓解：若业务无需 userfaultfd 功能，可在内核启动参数中禁用 userfaultfd 模块，或通过 seccomp 过滤器限制进程调用 mremap() 和 mprotect() 系统调用，避免触发页表标志不一致问题。更新内核后需重启系统使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0cef0bb836e3cfe00f08f9606c72abd72fe78ca3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/310ac886d68de661c3a334198d8604b722d7fdf8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/dd39090b66ba37823c9d39b1b14ea39a58874d96/2025/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21696.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-216xx/CVE-2025-21696.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21696"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0933.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0932","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0932.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21694","title":"Linux kernel fs/proc 软锁死拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 fs/proc 子系统的 __read_vmcore 函数在处理 vmcore 文件读取时存在软锁漏洞。在 kdump 崩溃转储的内存受限环境中，该函数第二个循环缺少足够的调度点，导致 CPU 长时间被占用而无法被抢占，触发内核软锁告警。此软锁会干扰 RCU 机制的内存释放操作，进而导致 kdump 崩溃转储过程卡住，无法完成系统崩溃后的内存采集工作。攻击者需要具备本地低权限访问权限，在系统执行 kdump 操作时无需额外用户交互即可触发此漏洞，造成系统可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21694"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-12T14:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:02Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至已修复的稳定版本。上游修复提交为 649b266606bc，已合入内核 4.20、5.4.290、5.10.234、5.15.177、6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11。Debian 用户应安装 bullseye 安全更新（DLA-4075）；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户需将内核升级至 5.15.0-1077.83 或更高版本，Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 标准支持已结束，建议升级至 22.04 LTS 或应用 FIPS 更新 5.4.0-1142.153+fips1。执行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image，然后重启系统。若短期内无法升级，可在 kdump 配置中禁用 vmcore 读取作为临时缓解措施，或限制本地用户对 /proc/vmcore 的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/649b266606bc413407ce315f710c8ce8a88ee30a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65c367bd9d4f43513c7f837df5753bea9561b836","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/80828540dad0757b6337c6561d49c81038f38d87","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/80da29deb88a3a907441fc35bb7bac309f31e713","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/84c4ed15626574c9ac6c1039ba9c137a77bcc7f2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a5a2ee8144c3897d37403a69118c3e3dc5713958","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cbc5dde0a461240046e8a41c43d7c3b76d5db952","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-355557.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-398330.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21694.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21694.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21694.json